[{"id":"d06-checkpoint-not-memory","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent Harness","tags":["Agent Harness","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(六)状态与持久化.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(六)状态与持久化","articlePath":"posts/d398d906/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(六)状态与持久化.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(六)状态与持久化","articlePath":"posts/d398d906/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“恢复读取”的课程边界中，为什么“检查点”不是“记忆”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>检查点只提供追加顺序；记忆还需要在commit上由状态一致确认，不能只看文本或单个事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在persist夹具中分别运行“检查点”和“记忆”，比较序列与幂等键与checkpoint 与版本；事件完整不代表业务正确；恢复后仍需检查副作用和权限。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"e08-mock-boundary","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 质量工程","tags":["Agent 质量工程","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(八)评测运行器.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(八)评测运行器","articlePath":"posts/48dacc68/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(八)评测运行器.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(八)评测运行器","articlePath":"posts/48dacc68/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“结果存储”的课程边界应该如何验证边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>围绕reset准备允许、拒绝、Unknown 和取消四类样本，再用越界停止与差异可解释分别断言权限、错误和副作用。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>边界测试的重点是责任转移瞬间。Mock 通过只证明替身契约；真实网络、权限和资源需在集成层验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-IP-014","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["端口","四元组"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么相同的端口号不代表相同的 TCP/UDP 会话？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>协议、源/目标 IP 和源/目标端口共同确定端点关系；TCP 与 UDP 还属于不同传输空间。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 192.168.10.10:53000 到 198.51.100.20:443 与 UDP 使用同样数字端口，也不是同一会话。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>会话识别可以写成：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">(protocol, source IP, source port, destination IP, destination port)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>相同数字端口只占一个字段；协议或任一地址不同，观察到的连接/数据报上下文就可能不同。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-FAQ-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","字节流","消息边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":15,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 能保证消息一次完整到达吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能。TCP 提供有序字节流；一次写入可能被拆成多个段，一次读取也可能得到半条或多条应用消息。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>应用协议需要自己定义长度、分隔符或帧格式。TCP 的可靠性不等于保留应用消息边界。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>应用协议必须自行划分消息，例如：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">[4 字节长度][payload]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">或\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">[一行一条消息\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">或\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">[BEGIN][内容][END]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>TCP 只保证字节按序到达；一次 send() 与一次 recv() 没有一一对应关系。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a2-type-which","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["命令解析","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么排查命令来源优先用 type -a，而不是只用 which？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>type -a 能识别别名、函数、内建和多个外部路径；which 通常只查 PATH 中的外部文件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>例如，别名会在 PATH 搜索之前生效：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">alias\u003c/span> ll=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;ls -lh&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> -a ll       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 先看到 alias\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> -a \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ls\u003c/span>       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 可能同时看到 builtin 和外部路径\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">command\u003c/span> -v \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ls\u003c/span>    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 脚本中只需要“能否调用”时使用\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此 \u003ccode>which\u003c/code> 找不到的并不一定是“不能执行”，它可能是 Shell 内建或函数；脚本判断仍应使用 POSIX 的 \u003ccode>command -v\u003c/code>，交互排障则用 \u003ccode>type -a\u003c/code> 看完整解析链。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-cart-journey","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","购物车","一致性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何测试购物车从游客到结算的完整流程？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先确认游客持久化和登录合并规则，再覆盖勾选、库存/价格变化、重进和结算前后的数据一致性。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>固定规则：游客购物车保存在会话；登录时同 SKU 数量相加但最多 5 件；库存不足时结算阻止；价格变化提示用户确认；只结算勾选项。模型：游客/登录身份状态 + 商品数量/价格状态。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>用例\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>前置与数据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>步骤与观察\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>预期\u003c/th>\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\">优先级\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>选择理由\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CJ-01\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>游客；商品 A 库存 5；购物车为空\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>加购 2 件→刷新→观察数量和价格\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>会话保留 2 件 A；无重复行\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>游客持久化\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CJ-02\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>游客有 A×2；账号已有 A×4\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>加购→登录→观察合并结果和数量\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>合并为 A×5（上限 5）；显示一次提示；不丢数据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>跨身份关系\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CJ-03\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>购物车 A×2；库存降为 1；单价从 10 改 12\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>刷新→进入结算→观察提示、金额和可选状态\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>提示库存/价格变化；阻止提交，服务端不创建订单\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>外部变化\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CJ-04\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>多商品；取消勾选一项\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>勾选/取消→进入结算→观察选中集合和金额\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>只结算勾选项；购物车总数和小计可解释\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>选择状态\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CJ-05\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>同账号跨页面重进；再换另一账号\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>重进/退出登录→观察购物车和权限\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>数据按账号隔离；未授权用户不可见\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>生命周期与权限\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>选择理由：游客、合并、库存/价格变化、勾选和账号隔离覆盖跨页面功能。遗漏与追问：多设备同时修改、优惠券、删除最后一项、离线编辑、合并冲突责任和结算失败恢复。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]